      en: ["Kololi is home to the Senegambia Strip, the tourism heart of The Gambia.", "The adjacent Bijilo Forest Park was established as a reserve in 1951.", "The town is located approximately 15 kilometers west of the capital, Banjul.", "Mass tourism development in the area began in the early 1970s.", "Bijilo Forest Park hosts four primate species, including the Western Red Colobus.", "The town is a major hub for international banking and bureau de change services."],
