      en: ["Dippa Kunda is one of the original settlement cores of modern Serrekunda.", "The neighborhood is a major center for automotive repair and metalwork in Gambia.", "Its central location makes it a primary interchange for shared taxis (bush taxis).", "Dippa Kunda retains several traditional Mandinka family compounds.", "The population density in this district is among the highest in West Africa.", "The local market is highly regarded for its wide selection of textiles and housewares."],
